## The silhouette genre

Call it amber pop: tape saturation, slow attack, everything mixed like it reached you through a wall. The genre's subject is distance itself.

## Warmth as a claim

Analog warmth is never neutral. Choosing it is choosing to sound like the past, which is always an argument about the present.
